    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "description": "How long each Litmus experiment ran, by chaos engine and chaos result \u2014 the chaos timeline this board is organised around. Line these steps up with the troughs in `Broker pod readiness` and the dips in the Kates row below: everything on this board is read relative to when the fault was being applied. This is the duration of the *injection*, not of the recovery.",
